        374.06707763671875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "2553f26f7e2ae480f9b4fe057d2e6ec693b3c564ab900c363ffff745f17a0467"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0950-block-0016",
      "order": 16,
      "text": "The Mental Capacity Act 2005 states that\n",
