        95.17440032958984,
        424.5970764160156
      ],
      "text_sha256": "48b5228f83705959ddbb0953c17a6c561f40a8eb08960041e6fa7e0d8536ffbe"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0950-block-0019",
      "order": 19,
      "text": "■\n■people are not to be treated as unable to make a decision unless all practicable steps \n",
      "bbox": [
