      "text_sha256": "6bdf4a3213bc4bb284c0643c743c84ddec48309be6ef35c2472db19bbdab7f31"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0950-block-0020",
      "order": 20,
      "text": "to help them do so have been taken without success; and\n",
      "bbox": [
        56.844398498535156,
        436.8770751953125,
        301.33441162109375,
        448.5970764160156
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f0e1699b9f09d85720d19163fabd27ca7a028e5c346297baa02036551bcf3246"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0950-block-0021",
      "order": 21,
      "text": "■\n■people are not to be treated as unable to make a decision merely because they make \n",
      "bbox": [
        48.03929901123047,
        448.8770751953125,
        422.8443298339844,
        460.5970764160156
      ],
      "text_sha256": "cf54e933a5fa5b7868ce1f4f55e326a62e386acfbb9a688d8487e2274139a8ab"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0950-block-0022",
      "order": 22,
      "text": "an unwise decision\n",
      "bbox": [
        56.844398498535156,
        460.8770751953125,
        137.98439025878906,
        472.5970764160156
      ],
      "text_sha256": "b76c6638d371f3d7a21567227db8e915232e043353f10a9f93ee3c68ba85fc92"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0950-block-0023",
      "order": 23,
      "text": "A patient is deemed to lack capacity if they cannot:\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.04439926147461,
        478.8770751953125,
        268.5943908691406,
        490.5970764160156
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e8aa0821f7013586f51774802dc956370aedbd539822848f463b4bf63d00f880"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0950-block-0024",
      "order": 24,
      "text": "■\n■understand relevant information about the decision to be made\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.03929901123047,
        499.8770751953125,
        329.1043701171875,
        511.5970764160156
      ],
      "text_sha256": "ed6cfb4410537435e3e157f3227068305be9809204f2eb4150b30aae48d5eb5f"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0950-block-0025",
      "order": 25,
      "text": "or\n",
      "bbox": [
        56.844398498535156,
